    {
      "key": "gg.mach.turret_team",
      "title": "Friend or Foe",
      "tier": "HV",
      "desc": [
        "A turret shoots every hostile mob. What it does to players depends on its Security button: set above public it shoots any player who is not you or your friend, where a friend is an ally or better on your ServerUtilities team. Without ServerUtilities only the owner is a friend. Target Animals makes it shoot passive creatures too.",
        "Put a gun and magazines in the turret and set its security. A Thompson with two magazines will do.",
        "[warn]A turret fires on players it does not know, including a visiting friend who has not joined your team.[/warn]"
      ],
