    {
      "key": "gg.mach.turret_power",
      "title": "Powering the Turret",
      "tier": "HV",
      "desc": [
        "The turret takes EU at its tier. Feed it from a battery buffer or generator through a cable of the right voltage. GregTech's usual overvoltage rules apply, so a cable carrying too much power for it will damage it.",
        "Its screen shows its state (On guard, No gun, No power) and its stored EU. Build a plate of armor for it: steel plates are LV, aluminum MV.",
        "[note]A powered turret heals its mount, so keep a buffer in reserve.[/note]"
      ],
